  "limits": "Stylized and not physically based: scene lights, shadows and bounce light do not affect it, because the light direction is a material parameter and the colour is emitted. The rim follows the facing angle, so flat faces seen edge-on darken entirely; it is not a true outline. Rendered here with Cycles CPU only. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
